---
import { challenges } from '../../data/portfolio.js';
---
<section class="slide white" id="challenge" data-section>
  <div class="slide-canvas"><div class="canvas-inner">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="section-kicker">03 · The Challenge</span><h2>Complex problems need product structure.</h2><p>These are the recurring enterprise constraints I solve through product framing, system thinking, workflow design and measurable delivery.</p></div>
    <div class="challenge-layout">
      <aside class="challenge-intro"><div class="challenge-orbit"><span>PRODUCT<br />PROBLEM</span></div><h3>From ambiguity to an executable product.</h3><p>Separate symptoms from root causes, identify dependencies, then make the workflow, data and decision model explicit.</p></aside>
      <div class="challenge-grid">
        {challenges.map(([number, title, text]) => <article class="challenge-card"><span>{number}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><div class="response">Product response <b>→</b></div></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>
